  "body": "## Changelog\n* ecb4c5a900a58cb0a70ef4780e536dea0b3b2429 Merge pull request #2 from devgar/issue1-gh-token-comp\n* a699ec6f64cf90911e4360224a7011e4fa1cdddc add installation and configuration instructions\n* 8e45cea33197318a4e9c17dec6f1c083e30b677e cleanup, format, add some basic tests\n* 28a8b7a04cebd1e6df913e47b647983400950c13 feat: brows tries to get token from gh cli if the env var is not set\n* 6e8a975e6fdbb81c1adb3218e20485d99848e9ca migrate goreleaser config to v2: archives, brews→homebrew_casks, snapshot.version_template\n* cca4af07c06334e0c6fd993a9b0e910ae66b9300 minor cleanup\n* e55adf82c5692407795b5cacd733354558ac53d5 shout out to charm\n* 1eb3777aff3e300087e133ab323827703d68149e update deprecated goreleaser flag\n* 0a303b8dbe6ef7581a9a7e58e83de3f42c67576d update release process\n\n"
